    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychedelic escape room where a player eats pills to solve puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/7c6d23dfc59dc8a565cc97220e572978.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to one of the most <strong>unique\u00a0</strong>and <strong>bizarre\u00a0</strong>VR experiences, where you take on the role of an investigator searching for a missing woman \u2014 and are forced to consume drugs during your mission. <strong>The boundaries between reality, virtuality, and hallucinations dissolve,</strong> immersing you in a <strong>Lovecraftian nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/86602ede50b848ebef40a97fb03e0623.poster.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/86602ede50b848ebef40a97fb03e0623.webm?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/86602ede50b848ebef40a97fb03e0623.mp4?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small German town, the only daughter of a retired businessman vanishes without a trace. Hired to investigate the case, the player discovers a seemingly abandoned laboratory. As you explore room after room, you uncover evidence of twisted experiments, scattered notebooks of employees, and disturbing accounts from test subjects. <strong>The gameplay revolves around solving intricate puzzles while piecing together the unsettling truth of the past.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/993af9e123b0c70941e2138cf6f34efd.poster.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/993af9e123b0c70941e2138cf6f34efd.webm?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/993af9e123b0c70941e2138cf6f34efd.mp4?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a haunting world filled with <strong>grotesque biotechnological machinery</strong> and <strong>the wicked remnants of dark experiments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/b3b0884662f56c98627efbd2335f389b.poster.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/b3b0884662f56c98627efbd2335f389b.webm?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/b3b0884662f56c98627efbd2335f389b.mp4?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience mind-bending psychedelic trips</strong> that distort perception and twist your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/56deeb24fe7e44f973717943275b5228.poster.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/56deeb24fe7e44f973717943275b5228.webm?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/56deeb24fe7e44f973717943275b5228.mp4?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the surreal horror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DISCLAIMER: the page currently features Standalone Meta Quest Early Access footage.  The nonVR version with improved graphics is in the development. Once flat version is in playable stage the page will be updated and we will release a demo that support both nonVR and VR modes.</i></p>",
