_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/993af9e123b0c70941e2138cf6f34efd.poster.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/993af9e123b0c70941e2138cf6f34efd.webm?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/993af9e123b0c70941e2138cf6f34efd.mp4?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a haunting world filled with <strong>grotesque biotechnological machinery</strong> and <strong>the wicked remnants of dark experiments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/b3b0884662f56c98627efbd2335f389b.poster.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/b3b0884662f56c98627efbd2335f389b.webm?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/b3b0884662f56c98627efbd2335f389b.mp4?t=1752660950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience mind-bending psychedelic trips</strong> that distort perception and twist your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/56deeb24fe7e44f973717943275b5228.poster.avif?t=1752660950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492640/extras/56deeb24fe7e44f973717943275b5228.webm?t=1